			"hadithnumber": 1779,
			"arabicnumber": 1779,
			"text": "Narrated Abu Hurairah: That the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"When one of you dons sandals, then let him begin with the right. And when he removes them then let him begin with left, so that the right will be the first to put on and the last of them removed.\" [Abu 'Eisa said:] This Hadith is Hasan Sahih",
